		<div class="self-stretch px-5 py-3.5 border-t border-neutral-200 flex flex-col justify-start items-start">
			<div class="self-stretch inline-flex justify-center items-center">
				<div class="flex-1 justify-center text-zinc-800 text-xl font-bold font-['Mulish']">§ 14. Polubowne sposoby rozwiązywania sporów konsumenckich</div>
				<div class="w-6 h-6 relative origin-top-left -rotate-180 overflow-hidden">
					<div class="w-2.5 h-1.5 left-[6.70px] top-[8.87px] absolute bg-stone-400"></div>
